### Valid body
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enrollments/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_name":"  Ananya  ","course_code":"cse401","semester":4,"mode":"online","credits":4}

### Wrong semester -> 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enrollments/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_name":"Ananya","course_code":"cse401","semester":12,"mode":"online","credits":4}

### Extra field -> 422
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/enrollments/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_name":"Ananya","course_code":"cse401","semester":4,"mode":"online","credits":4,"admin":true}
